_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA4j3gA","user":{"login":"MikkBenelis","id":17128667,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTI4NjY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17128667?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis","html_url":"https://github.com/MikkBenelis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-30T16:30:54Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T16:30:54Z","body":"It will become reproducible in a new project if you enable this warning as error, create an autoload with coroutine, reference it in any script and delete the `.godot` folder before opening the project. It is quite hard to find the exact root cause of an issue: could be uid://-related, could be related to warnings as errors or maybe using a coroutine in autoload with this configuration breaks the parser. I've attached the most minimal MRP I was able to make...\n\nSetups with all these features enabled (warnings, autoloads and coroutines) are quite often in my projects, so that is why I remember it since 4.4 or earlier builds. I'm wondering if I'm not the only one who faced it since it reproduces only for the \"clean\" project startup with all preconditions met, but I have not found any related issues reported.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos